curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:315:- **Real-life situation:** Asking for and understanding directions to a nearby place.
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:316:- **Can do:** I can follow short, slow directions with two turns.
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:317:- **Primary language structure:** Formal `Sie` imperative in high-frequency direction instructions.
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:329:- **Can do:** I can ask where a place is and give short supported directions.
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:335:- **Deliberately recycled:** home and room words (L19); location phrases and `dort` (L20); `helfen` (L21); weather (L22); directions (L23).
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:350:- **Deliberately recycled:** `die Haltestelle` (L24); directions (L23); prices and quantities (L14); `ich möchte`, `bitte` (L13).
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:438:- **Primary language structure:** Formal imperative `Nehmen Sie …` in health instructions, building on direction imperatives.
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:495:- **Deliberately recycled:** directions and neighbourhood services (L23–L24); doctor/pharmacy language (L31–L32); clothing choice (L33); postal steps (L34); bank/police problem (L35).
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:655:- **Deliberately recycled:** identity and repair (L1–L6); personal data/time/routine (L7–L12); transactions (L13–L18); location/directions (L19–L24); transport/travel (L25–L30); health/services (L31–L36); work/leisure/plans/reasons (L37–L42); connected past/messages/notices (L43–L47).
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:671:| Follow short directions and simple instructions | L23–L24, L26, L32, L34, L36, L45. |
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:673:| Read very short messages, notices, forms, descriptions, and directions | L4–L5, L7–L8, L15, L19, L25, L29, L34, L37, L45–L46. |
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:731:| Location and directions (L19–L23) | L24 | L25–L30 | L34–L37, L45, L47 | L48 |
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:743:- **Speaking:** Guided role-plays move from single adjacency pairs (L2) to short service exchanges, directions, arrangements, reasons, and the final four-minute supported interaction (L48).
curriculum/a1_blueprint.md:768:| Mid A1.2 | 19–24 | 4–5 sentences/turns; 42–58 words | Spatial reference, pronouns, cause/result, and two-step directions |
